    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28260" root="عجن" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجِنٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَعَجِّنٌ</span></b>  (K) A camel <i>compact,</i> or <i>firm, by reason of fatness;</i> (S, K, TA;)
<i>as though consisting of flesh without bone.</i> (TA.)
